{"steam_appid":3432650,"steam_name":"追曙","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3432650/375975289/ec25760cd04015c776b0bb212976a5feb629e73b/1778474471/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1778475475","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257334575/635eaa603612086fcaf8f51b8a932046f98d7071/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1778475475","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/f0619b3c5c618611b67a2c268879281969f3c6a6/ss_f0619b3c5c618611b67a2c268879281969f3c6a6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778490012","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/f988fc0bdcedea1063a23b97b19d4c5d985278b2/ss_f988fc0bdcedea1063a23b97b19d4c5d985278b2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778490012","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/5b9c094f703f73dab102f3ad17d8f69bc2574434/ss_5b9c094f703f73dab102f3ad17d8f69bc2574434.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778490012","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/43071ebae8e5e3ab8fd5da1484b6ccda0093c9d7/ss_43071ebae8e5e3ab8fd5da1484b6ccda0093c9d7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778490012","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/32ef43b59299d1486140e941284308b9a9f312f7/ss_32ef43b59299d1486140e941284308b9a9f312f7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778490012"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>追曙ZhuiShu is a horror narrative puzzle game set in Southeast Asia, weaving together elements of traditional Chinese folklore.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A buried death. Two interwoven fates.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/0f5886b68fcc615656693f0f9bb62e3f.avif?t=1778490012\" width=622 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Synopsis</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yang Fan, a righteous police officer, receives a cryptic radio distress call during his night shift: &quot;...the mountains...save the children...&quot; The signal originates from an abandoned apartment building - official records show it was the site of a young girl's suicide years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jiang Yufei, an ordinary teacher, gets drawn into the mystery after her student's inexplicable death. Each clue she uncovers pulls her deeper into a dangerous truth no one dares confront.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When their fates intersect across time, they must confront a cruel truth—death is not the end, but the beginning of a greater conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/ac9b3e154377a39d04dbd505aa1c1134.poster.avif?t=1778490012\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/ac9b3e154377a39d04dbd505aa1c1134.webm?t=1778490012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/ac9b3e154377a39d04dbd505aa1c1134.mp4?t=1778490012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/8fbc2f0d104a62f5e1237d89a0afd98f.avif?t=1778490012\" width=622 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light puzzle-solving seamlessly woven into the narrative flow creates an immersive experience that propels the story forward naturally. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore meticulously crafted environments to gather clues and items, unraveling hidden truths through intuitive puzzle-solving that progresses organically with the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/e6d20950747e75b1707459aa6a662a64.poster.avif?t=1778490012\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/e6d20950747e75b1707459aa6a662a64.webm?t=1778490012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/e6d20950747e75b1707459aa6a662a64.mp4?t=1778490012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/55157b6e0a8445281aded1e1dbeda493.avif?t=1778490012\" width=622 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Narrative</strong>: Alternate between detective Yang Fan and teacher Jiang Yufei to uncover a deliberately erased past</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong>: Oppressive environments, eerie whispers and fragmented clues slowly reveal a suffocating truth</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True-Crime Inspired</strong>: Drawing from real cases, the game blends Eastern cultural elements with profound themes of fate, choice and human nature beneath its terrifying surface</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/244f2195d5f692a7e1d4e28847617332.poster.avif?t=1778490012\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/244f2195d5f692a7e1d4e28847617332.webm?t=1778490012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432650/extras/244f2195d5f692a7e1d4e28847617332.mp4?t=1778490012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZhuiShu</strong>, meaning &quot;Chasing Dawn&quot; in Chinese, symbolizes the relentless pursuit of light and hope amidst overwhelming darkness. It embodies the journey of uncovering hidden truths, facing inner fears, and striving for clarity in a world shrouded in mystery.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6200U 2.3GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce Gtx 950M<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6200U 2.3GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce Gtx 950M<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["悄语灯"],"publishers":["悄语灯","Paras Games"],"release_date":"11 May, 2026"}